        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY PLEASE***\n\nAllen & Jacobs is delighted to present this pristine, recently refurbished two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment. This light, bright and stylish ground-floor residence provides spacious open plan living and well laid out accommodation with extensive use of timber flooring, built in wardrobes and excellent storage. Presented in simply excellent condition throughout and with its convenient location, impressive features, and included parking, this apartment represents exceptionally comfortable and convenient urban living.\n\nSeamount Apartments are conveniently located just off the Stillorgan Road (N11), close to Booterstown, Mount Merrion, Blackrock and Stillorgan. A wide range of amenities are within easy walking distance, including local shops, cafes, bars and services at The Rise, Mount Merrion, while UCD Belfield is also within walking distance. The property benefits from excellent transport links, with Booterstown Dart Station, Bus routes including the E1, E2 and S6, the Aircoach service to Dublin Airport is easily accessible. The N11 and M50 are also within easy reach.\n\nAccommodation briefly compromises entrance hall, open plan living/dining, kitchen, two double bedrooms, an ensuite, family bathroom and large sit out balcony.\n\nAt A Glance\nPresented in excellent condition\nRecently refurbished\nSpacious ground floor apartment\nGFCH\nBuilt in wardrobes and excellent storage\nExtensive use of timber floors\nDesignated parking space\nLarge sit-out balcony\nBeside UCD & QBC\nClose to Booterstown DART Station\nEasy reach to City centre\nClose to all amenities\n\nViewing\nStrictly by prior appointment only with sole agents\nAllen & Jacobs (Southside Office)\n107 Fosters Avenue\nMount Merrion, Co. Dublin\ne: lettings@allenandjacobs.ie\nw: allenandjacobs.ie"
      },
